{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SessionKey"}],"symbolKind":"enum","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Events\/SessionKey.swift#L24","fileName":"SessionKey.swift"},"modules":[{"name":"Events"}],"role":"symbol","title":"SessionKey","roleHeading":"Enumeration","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SessionKey"}],"externalID":"s:6Events10SessionKeyO"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SessionKey"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A destination reads it from each record’s context:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["let session = record.context[SessionKey.self]  \/\/ a UUID"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The identifier is a version 7 UUID: its first 48 bits are the session’s start, the timestamp","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of its first record, in Unix milliseconds, and the other 74 bits that aren’t the version and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"variant are random, never derived from the device, the user or another identifier. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"enricher keeps it in memory only, so a new tracker, as on the next launch, starts a new session","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with a new identifier.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A store keeps it beside each record of the session, as part of the record’s own bytes, and it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is deleted when the store deletes the record’s bytes (a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SegmentStore"},{"text":": once its whole segment","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is delivered). So a record recovered after a relaunch carries the session it was tracked in,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and a destination sends it under the same identifier as before. It is the one identifier in a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"record’s context a store keeps, and a store never keeps it apart from a record.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/events\/sessionkey"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/15Instrumentation0A10ContextKeyP","doc:\/\/Events\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Events\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events"]]},"kind":"symbol","seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Context-a-store-keeps","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SampleRateKey","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SampleRate","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/InvalidSampleRate","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ScreenKey","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ApplicationKey","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DeviceKey","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/OperatingSystemKey","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/LocaleKey","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/NetworkKey"],"title":"Context a store keeps","generated":true}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Type-Aliases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SessionKey\/Value"],"title":"Type Aliases","generated":true},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SessionKey\/InstrumentationContextKey-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SessionKey